# Personal life-data privacy

Files under `personal/` are the user’s private records (nutrition, body metrics, habits, daily mood).

- Do not volunteer summaries of metrics/CSV in unrelated chats.
- Only read/analyze when the user asks about their logs or tracking.
- Prefer linking theory docs in `guides/04-lifestyle-os/` for educational answers; use `personal/` for their recorded data.
- Never commit secrets (passwords, OTP, others’ PII) into new personal notes.
